Benny is a boy of nine in [[Org/Iconoclasm/index|Iconoclasm]], serious beyond his years and hard to one-up. He is an android, built by the [[Org/Belvedere/Atum|Heart Atum]] of [[Org/Belvedere/index|Belvedere]], and has looked nine years old since the day he was made; age has not changed his shape yet. He carries a heavy pick he calls an exemplar weapon, an aspect of himself, and has since added a falcata, a chainsword and a nodachi, a two-handed blade near twice his height. He picks the Party's locks, drives its car and keeps its money. He wears a sailcloth sports poncho made for him by [[Org/Garrick Textiles/index|Garrick Textiles]], and answers to false names such as Bennix Plasmadio when the Party needs them.

Belvedere lets its Hearts act with more freedom than most Orgs allow, and some of them, to reach further into the world, learned to make new beings and imbue them with the same process that makes a Heart. Atum is one of these, and calls himself Benny's father. The rest of Atum's children look however they please and may be rogue. Benny reports to his father in his sleep, across a black void, and the two also trade faxes. His father shows himself as a shifting shape of light circled by three turning rings, passes on what [[Org/Belvedere/index|Belvedere]] learns, and set Benny to find a twelve-sided green stone, ringing with the [[Phenomena/Harmony/Voidsong|Voidsong]], that was stolen from a Belvedere archive.

He was killed in the attack on the [[Org/Roundhat Gang/index|Roundhat Gang]] at [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Sableclutch/The Crowded Flea|the Crowded Flea]] and came back, and now bears [[Aut]]'s hidden mark. Aut has broken with the Party for going to the [[Divinity/The Narrative/Menhir|Menhir]] instead of him, and the mark burned on Benny when he did. The piece of himself he left behind in the [[Pharos]] was later called back into him. He helped kill the half-giant [[Org/Roundhat Gang/People/Hlarf|Hlarf]] to honor [[People/Argyle|Argyle]].

He keeps company with [[People/Johnny|Johnny Skyfall]], [[People/Anzu|Anzu]] and [[People/Sir Arctos|Sir Arctos]]. Over the Party's six months of downtime he worked as a security advisor to the guards of the [[Geography/Calaria/Eilebrin Observatory|Eilebrin Observatory]].
